==Central Nahuatl==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/atʃtoːntɬi/|lang=nhn}}

===Etymology===
Related to '''[[achto]]''' "first".

===Noun===
{{nhn-noun|a|achtontli}}

'''achtōntli'''

# [[great-grandfather|Great-grandfather]].
#* '''1555:''' [[w:Alonso de Molina|Alonso de Molina]], ''[[w:Aqui comienca un vocabulario en la lengua castellana y mexicana|Aqui comienca un vocabulario en la lengua castellana y mexicana]]'', f. 244r.
#*: Viſauelo. '''achtontli'''.
#* c. '''1609:''' [[w:Fernando Alvarado Tezozomoc|Tezozomoc]], [[w:Chimalpahin|Chimalpahin]], ''[[w:Cronica mexicayotl|Cronica mexicayotl]]'', f. 18r.
#*: yn huehuetque yllamatque. catca yn tocihuan tocolhuan yn '''tachtõhuan''' yn tomintonhuan yn topiptonhuã yn tochichicahuan
#*: (those who were the ancient ones, men and women, our grandmothers, grandfathers, great-grandfathers, great-great grandparents, great-grandmothers, our forefathers)

====Usage notes====
Usually occurs with a possessive prefix.

